.DS_Store

# Local scratch state, not project config.
.claude/

# THIS REPO IS PUBLIC, and it is a download host — "It holds no source code."
#
# Release artifacts are uploaded to the Releases page with `gh release create`
# from screenshepherd-app/release/. They are attachments; they never belong in
# the tree. A 690 MB dmg committed here could not be taken back — a public repo
# that people and mirrors have already cloned keeps its history.
*.dmg
*.zip
*.blockmap
latest-mac.yml

# Nothing with a credential in it belongs in any repo, and least of all in a
# public one. Belt-and-braces: these are the shapes that would do the damage.
.env
.env.*
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.pem
